      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n      background: #2d1b4e;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n      color: #f0e6ff;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: #4a2c7a;\n      border: 4px solid #f0e6ff;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 400px;\n      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1a0e2e;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: #ffd93d;\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #1a0e2e;\n    }\n    label {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #f0e6ff;\n    }\n    .row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .row > div { flex: 1; }\n    input, select, button {\n      width: 100%;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 3px solid #1a0e2e;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: #f0e6ff;\n      color: #1a0e2e;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n    }\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n      outline: 3px solid #ffd93d;\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n    button {\n      background: #ffd93d;\n      color: #1a0e2e;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1a0e2e;\n    }\n    button:hover {\n      background: #ffe066;\n      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);\n      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #1a0e2e;\n    }\n    button:active {\n      transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #1a0e2e;\n    }\n    .result-box {\n      background: #1a0e2e;\n      border: 3px solid #ffd93d;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 16px;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .result-label {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      color: #a88fd6;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n    #result {\n      font-size: 32px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #ffd93d;\n      word-break: break-all;\n      min-height: 48px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .error-text { color: #ff6b6b !important; }\n    [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .card { padding: 16px; }\n      .row { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"left\">Left</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"left\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"0\">\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"right\">Right</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"right\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"0\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n        <select id=\"operation\">\n          <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n          <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n          <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n          <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <div class=\"result-box\">\n      <div class=\"result-label\">Result</div>\n      <div id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\n  const rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\n  const operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\n  const calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  const resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function showError() {\n    resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n    resultEl.classList.add('error-text');\n  }\n\n  function showResult(value) {\n    resultEl.textContent = String(value);\n    resultEl.classList.remove('error-text');\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    const leftStr = leftInput.value.trim();\n    const rightStr = rightInput.value.trim();\n\n    if (leftStr === '' || rightStr === '') {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const left = Number(leftStr);\n    const right = Number(rightStr);\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const op = operationSelect.value;\n    let result;\n\n    switch (op) {\n      case 'add':\n        result = left + right;\n        break;\n      case 'subtract':\n        result = left - right;\n        break;\n      case 'multiply':\n        result = left * right;\n        break;\n      case 'divide':\n        if (right === 0) {\n          showError();\n          return;\n        }\n        result = left / right;\n        break;\n      default:\n        showError();\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    showResult(result);\n  }\n\n  calculateBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n  [leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(el => {\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        calculate();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Calculator\n\nA pixel-style two-number calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline—no packages, network requests, or storage.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs (`left` and `right`), supports negative values and decimals.\n- Operation dropdown (`add`, `subtract`, `multiply`, `divide`).\n- Calculate button (`calculate`).\n- Result area (`result`) initially shows `0`.\n- Rejects empty inputs, non-finite numbers, and division by zero with the exact text `Error`.\n- Keyboard accessible: press Enter in any input or the dropdown to calculate.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n- Pixel-art inspired styling with a cohesive 4-color palette.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Enter two numbers, choose an operation, and click **Calculate** (or press Enter). The result appears below.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and styles\n- `script.js` – calculator logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
